==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**8 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**8 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**8 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For {{4c}}, this stage can be easily beaten by spamming [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba]], [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] (you can use combos to speed up the process). Another method is to spam Paris Cats and save up for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]].

